From 833cfd67b8240bf869a0abe0cfdae5c03761cadf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stijn <sbaselmans1@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 20:52:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] touchGrass: Android 17 build on BPF-backported base

- mm: add missing MEMFD_ASHMEM_SHIM Kconfig entry (Makefile/shmem hooks
  were merged but the option was never defined)
- configs: add touchgrass gsi/ebpf/a17 fragments (sockmap off: does not
  build on this tree and Android does not use it)
- camera: pass force_low_priority=false at Samsung call sites of
  camera_io_dev_write{,_continuous} after the qcom API change
- tas256x: fix misleading indentation (no functional change)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KfdEw7FqSm92uoQmEa9GaX
